  <h3 class="pg-section-title">Spacing Scale</h3>
  <p class="pg-section-desc">Every padding, margin and gap utility uses the same 0-7 scale. Spacing utilities use <code>!important</code>, so they override a component's own padding or margin (for example <code>sui-modal-body sui-p-0</code>).</p>
